		"description": "<p><em>Mechanical Mayhem turret — learned at level 7, 11 or 15.</em></p><p><strong>Thumper Turret.</strong> Utility. Burst 1, Damage: 1d8 Force. On a failed DEX save, Large and smaller enemies are knocked Prone; on a save they are Slowed, 1 turn. <strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Burst 2, Damage: INTd8 Force. On a failed DEX save, Large or smaller enemies are pushed INT spaces away (Prone if pushed the full distance), or Slowed, 1 minute, on a save.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Once picked, Turret Deployed! offers the Thumper Turret alongside the Rifle Turret.</em></p>",
